  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "The Blood of Dawnwalker Eclipse Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/22489/450x258/the-blood-of-dawnwalker-eclipse-edition-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1790719200",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/22489-buy-the-blood-of-dawnwalker-eclipse-edition-pc-steam/",
      "user": "YaBoiLuckus",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/12271979-1655578601.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Absolute Banger;\n\n\n\nI was worried about the combat cause my only concept of directional attacking and blocking is For Honor and I only ever hear about how frustrating that game is BUT this shit is elite. Way easier than For Honor combat even on the highest difficulty preset where it doesn’t display what direction to block in the movements are done very well so you can block or even parry the attacks without too much difficulty. \n\n\n\nAlso Story is great and you have a lot of freedom in how you want to play and the dialogue options are accurate. Won’t trick you with a “no” that actually ends up being like “no and I hate you and your mother and I’m gonna kill you” \n\n\n\nThe 30 day timer isn’t even much of an issue. Gives you a sense of urgency and kinda leads you to doing various quests be it night or day which is a nice gimmick to help it stand out. First playthrough I had like 3 days left but I’d done everything I wanted to do in that playthrough. Now with more knowledge on my second run managing the time is pretty easy.\n\n\n\n100% 1000% this is worth playing."
    },
    {
      "game": "WARDOGS",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/21740/450x258/wardogs-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1790719200",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/21740-buy-wardogs-pc-steam/",
      "user": "jahgaia",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/2176332-1480723453.jpg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "3 million copies sold and now huge numbers of players are getting WD-L020 and literally can’t even launch the game.\n\n\n\nAnd when you finally get in, it’s an amazing game full of griefers. People don’t even help you when you go down, they just loot your body. Cheaters everywhere too.\n\n\n\nGreat game, but right now the experience is fucking ridiculous."
    },
    {
      "game": "The Blood of Dawnwalker Eclipse Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/22489/450x258/the-blood-of-dawnwalker-eclipse-edition-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1790719200",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/22489-buy-the-blood-of-dawnwalker-eclipse-edition-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Prophet Noble",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/25931976-1790623271.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Overall great game combat can be clunky but does take away from the experience most of my negatives I heard they are supposed to be fixing in a future update also I'm a Linux gamer and this game runs great I do have some crashes but I don't blame the game on this could be weird Proton bugs. If you like the witcher and Rpgs give this one a try it honest kinda reminds me a little of the first greedfall.\n\n\n\nOverall rating 8/10"
    },
    {
      "game": "CONTROL Resonant Digital Deluxe Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/23785/450x258/control-resonant-digital-deluxe-edition-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1790719200",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/23785-buy-control-resonant-digital-deluxe-edition-pc-steam/",
